{"code":"ja","name":"Japanese","native":"日本語","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"A2","level":{"title":"Elementary: past, て-form, places, food","goals":["Talk about past with ました/でした","Request and describe ongoing actions with て","Move around, eat out and shop"],"units":[{"id":"A2-U1","title":"Past and て-form","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U1-L1","title":"Past: たべました/でした","learn":"Past is easy! ます→ました: たべました (ate), いきました (went). です→でした: がくせいでした (was a student). Negative past: たべませんでした! Time words: きのう (yesterday), きょう (today), あした (tomorrow)!","vocab":[{"t":"きのう","r":"kinou","en":"yesterday","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"きょう","r":"kyou","en":"today","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"あした","r":"ashita","en":"tomorrow","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"あさ","r":"asa","en":"morning","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ばん","r":"ban","en":"evening","pos":"noun"},{"t":"よる","r":"yoru","en":"night","pos":"noun"},{"t":"それから","r":"sorekara","en":"then / after that","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"もう","r":"mou","en":"already","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"ました/でした past","explain":"たべます→たべました, です→でした, じゃありません→じゃありませんでした. もう + past = already: もうたべました = I already ate!","pattern":"ました · でした · ませんでした","examples":[{"t":"きのう、ほんをよみました。","r":"kinou, hon-o yomimashita.","en":"Yesterday I read a book."},{"t":"がくせいでした。","r":"gakusei deshita.","en":"I was a student."},{"t":"もうたべました。","r":"mou tabemashita.","en":"I already ate."}],"mistakes":["Saying たべました for today-habits — ました = finished past!","Saying ですでした — です becomes でした (one word)!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"たろう","t":"きのう、なにをしましたか?","r":"kinou, nani-o shimashita ka?","en":"What did you do yesterday?"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"べんきょうしました。それから、あそびました!","r":"benkyou-shimashita. sorekara, asobimashita!","en":"I studied. Then I played!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"わたしははたらきました。","r":"watashi-wa hatarakimashita.","en":"I worked."},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"おつかれさま!","r":"otsukare-sama!","en":"Good work! / Thanks for your effort!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Yesterday I read a book","answer":"きのう、ほんをよみました"},{"type":"fill","q":"がくせい___。 (was)","answer":"でした"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I already ate' is…","options":["もうたべます","もうたべました","まだたべます","たべませんでした"],"answer":"もうたべました"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: よみました / ほんを / きのう","answer":"きのうほんをよみました"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: きのう、ほんをよみました。","answer":"きのう、ほんをよみました。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"たべました means…","options":["eat","ate","don't eat","will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"ました = past."},{"q":"でした means…","options":["is","was","isn't","will be"],"answer":1,"why":"です→でした."},{"q":"きのう means…","options":["today","yesterday","tomorrow","tonight"],"answer":1,"why":"きのう = yesterday."},{"q":"もう means…","options":["then","already","late","never"],"answer":1,"why":"もう = already."},{"q":"それから means…","options":["before","then / after that","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"それから = then."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Past tense worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["yesterday","already","then"],"key":["きのう","もう","それから"]},{"instruction":"Make pasts.","items":["I read (a book)","I was a student","I already ate"],"key":["よみました","がくせいでした","もうたべました"]},{"instruction":"Talk yesterday.","items":["What did you do yesterday?","Good work!"],"key":["きのう、なにをしましたか","おつかれさま"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U1-L2","title":"て-form: たべてください","learn":"The mighty て-form! たべて (eat-and…), のんで, よんで. て + ください = please do: たべてください! て + います = doing NOW: たべています! One form, endless power!","vocab":[{"t":"たべて","r":"tabete","en":"eat (te-form)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"のんで","r":"nonde","en":"drink (te-form)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"よんで","r":"yonde","en":"read (te-form)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"かいて","r":"kaite","en":"write (te-form)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"はなして","r":"hanashite","en":"speak (te-form)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"きいて","r":"kiite","en":"listen (te-form)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"みて","r":"mite","en":"see (te-form)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"きて","r":"kite","en":"come (te-form)","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"て + ください/います","explain":"みてください (please look), たべています (I am eating), しっています (I know — て-form of knowing!). Chain actions: あさごはんをたべて、がっこうへいきます!","pattern":"て + ください · て + います","examples":[{"t":"みてください!","r":"mite kudasai!","en":"Please look!"},{"t":"いま、たべています。","r":"ima, tabete-imasu.","en":"I am eating now."},{"t":"たべて、のみます。","r":"tabete, nomimasu.","en":"I eat and (then) drink."}],"mistakes":["Saying たべますください — ください needs て-form!","Saying たべますいます — now-doing needs て + います!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ゆき","t":"みてください!","r":"mite kudasai!","en":"Please look!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"なにをしていますか?","r":"nani-o shite-imasu ka?","en":"What are you doing?"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"ほんをよんでいます!","r":"hon-o yonde-imasu!","en":"I am reading a book!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"いいですね!","r":"ii desu ne!","en":"Nice!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Please look!","answer":"みてください"},{"type":"fill","q":"いま、たべて___。 (am -ing)","answer":"います"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I am reading a book' is…","options":["ほんをよみます","ほんをよんでいます","ほんをよんでください","ほんをよみました"],"answer":"ほんをよんでいます"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ください / みて","answer":"みてください"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: みてください!","answer":"みてください!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"みてください means…","options":["I see","please look","I saw","looking now"],"answer":1,"why":"て + ください = please do."},{"q":"たべています means…","options":["I eat (habit)","I am eating","please eat","I ate"],"answer":1,"why":"て + います = now-doing."},{"q":"きて means…","options":["go","come (te)","listen","write"],"answer":1,"why":"きて = come-te."},{"q":"Chain actions with…","options":["ます","て-form","でした","か"],"answer":1,"why":"たべて、のみます — te-links!"},{"q":"いいですね! means…","options":["no good","nice!","maybe","sorry"],"answer":1,"why":"いいですね = nice, isn't it!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"て-form worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["eat (te)","see (te)","come (te)"],"key":["たべて","みて","きて"]},{"instruction":"Request and now.","items":["Please look!","I am eating now","What are you doing?"],"key":["みてください","いま、たべています","なにをしていますか"]},{"instruction":"Chain.","items":["I eat and drink","Nice!"],"key":["たべて、のみます","いいですね"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U2","title":"Places and movement","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U2-L1","title":"Particles: に/へ/で","learn":"Place particles! に (to/at-point), へ (toward), で (action-at). がっこうへいきます (go to school), がっこうでべんきょうします (study AT school). ここ/そこ/あそこ = here/there/over there!","vocab":[{"t":"まち","r":"machi","en":"city / town","pos":"noun"},{"t":"みち","r":"michi","en":"street / road","pos":"noun"},{"t":"みせ","r":"mise","en":"shop","pos":"noun"},{"t":"しごと","r":"shigoto","en":"work","pos":"noun"},{"t":"こうえん","r":"kouen","en":"park","pos":"noun"},{"t":"はくぶつかん","r":"hakubutsukan","en":"museum","pos":"noun"},{"t":"えき","r":"eki","en":"station","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ここ","r":"koko","en":"here","pos":"pronoun"}],"grammar":{"title":"に/へ (to) · で (action-at)","explain":"がっこうへいきます (go to school), うちにいます (am at home), がっこうでべんきょうします (study at school). Going = へ/に, doing-there = で!","pattern":"へ/に + go · で + action","examples":[{"t":"がっこうへいきます。","r":"gakkou-e ikimasu.","en":"I go to school."},{"t":"うちにいます。","r":"uchi-ni imasu.","en":"I am at home."},{"t":"がっこうでべんきょうします。","r":"gakkou-de benkyou-shimasu.","en":"I study at school."}],"mistakes":["Saying がっこうでいきます — going needs へ/に!","Saying がっこうへべんきょうします — actions need で!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ゆき","t":"どこへいきますか?","r":"doko-e ikimasu ka?","en":"Where are you going?"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"がっこうへいきます!","r":"gakkou-e ikimasu!","en":"I go to school!"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"わたしはみせへいきます。","r":"watashi-wa mise-e ikimasu.","en":"I go to the shop."},{"sp":"たろう","t":"いってらっしゃい!","r":"itte-rasshai!","en":"Have a good trip! (see you off)"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I go to school","answer":"がっこうへいきます"},{"type":"fill","q":"がっこう___べんきょうします。 (action-at)","answer":"で"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Where are you going?' is…","options":["どこにいますか","どこへいきますか","どこですか","なにをしますか"],"answer":"どこへいきますか"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: いきます / がっこうへ","answer":"がっこうへいきます"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: がっこうへいきます。","answer":"がっこうへいきます。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"へ marks…","options":["action-at","direction-to","object","subject"],"answer":1,"why":"へ = toward."},{"q":"で marks…","options":["direction","action-at","object","time"],"answer":1,"why":"がっこうで = at-school-doing."},{"q":"どこへいきますか? asks…","options":["where are you","where going","where was","what doing"],"answer":1,"why":"どこへ + いきます."},{"q":"えき means…","options":["museum","station","school","park"],"answer":1,"why":"えき = station."},{"q":"いってらっしゃい! is said…","options":["on arrival","when seeing off","at night","at meals"],"answer":1,"why":"いってらっしゃい = go-and-return!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Particles worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["town","park","here"],"key":["まち","こうえん","ここ"]},{"instruction":"へ or で?","items":["I go to school → …へ","I study at school → …で","I am at home → …に"],"key":["がっこうへいきます","がっこうでべんきょうします","うちにいます"]},{"instruction":"Going out.","items":["Where are you going?","Have a good trip!"],"key":["どこへいきますか","いってらっしゃい"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U2-L2","title":"いきます/きます/かえります","learn":"Move! いきます (go), きます (come), かえります (return home). Time + に: ろくじに (at 6). あした、がっこうへいきます = Tomorrow I go to school. Say いってきます! when leaving home!","vocab":[{"t":"いきます","r":"ikimasu","en":"to go","pos":"verb"},{"t":"きます","r":"kimasu","en":"to come","pos":"verb"},{"t":"かえります","r":"kaerimasu","en":"to return home","pos":"verb"},{"t":"とうきょう","r":"toukyou","en":"Tokyo","pos":"noun"},{"t":"にほん","r":"nihon","en":"Japan","pos":"noun"},{"t":"うち","r":"uchi","en":"home","pos":"noun"},{"t":"テーブル","r":"teeburu","en":"table","pos":"noun"},{"t":"えいが","r":"eiga","en":"movie","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Movement + timeに","explain":"ろくじにいきます (go at 6), あしたきます (come tomorrow). Leaving home: いってきます! Return: ただいま! Family answers: おかえり!","pattern":"time + に + movement","examples":[{"t":"ろくじにいきます。","r":"roku-ji-ni ikimasu.","en":"I go at six."},{"t":"あした、とうきょうへいきます。","r":"ashita, toukyou-e ikimasu.","en":"Tomorrow I go to Tokyo."},{"t":"いってきます!","r":"itte-kimasu!","en":"I'm off! (I'll go and come back)"}],"mistakes":["Saying ろくじいきます without に — clock-times need に!","Saying さようなら when leaving home — say いってきます!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"たろう","t":"いってきます!","r":"itte-kimasu!","en":"I'm off!"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"いってらっしゃい!","r":"itte-rasshai!","en":"Have a good trip!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"ただいま!","r":"tadaima!","en":"I'm home!"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"おかえり!","r":"okaeri!","en":"Welcome back!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I go at six","answer":"ろくじにいきます"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (I'm off!)","answer":"いってきます"},{"type":"choose","q":"Answer to ただいま is…","options":["いってきます","おかえり","いってらっしゃい","ただいま"],"answer":"おかえり"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: いきます / ろくじに","answer":"ろくじにいきます"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: いってきます!","answer":"いってきます!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"いってきます! means…","options":["goodbye forever","I'm off (and back)","welcome home","good night"],"answer":1,"why":"I'll go and come back!"},{"q":"ただいま! means…","options":["I'm off","I'm home","welcome","goodbye"],"answer":1,"why":"ただいま = just-now (home)!"},{"q":"ろくじに needs に because…","options":["place","clock-time","object","question"],"answer":1,"why":"Time-points take に."},{"q":"かえります means…","options":["to go","to come","to return home","to stay"],"answer":2,"why":"かえります = return home."},{"q":"えいが means…","options":["book","movie","music","game"],"answer":1,"why":"えいが = movie."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Movement worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["to go","to come","home"],"key":["いきます","きます","うち"]},{"instruction":"Move with time.","items":["I go at six","Tomorrow I go to Tokyo"],"key":["ろくじにいきます","あした、とうきょうへいきます"]},{"instruction":"Home rituals.","items":["I'm off! / Have a good trip!","I'm home! / Welcome back!"],"key":["いってきます / いってらっしゃい","ただいま / おかえり"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U3","title":"Food and shopping","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U3-L1","title":"すきです / ほしいです","learn":"Likes and wants! すしがすきです (I like sushi), みずがほしいです (I want water). が marks the liked/wanted thing! だいすき = love it! Order: カレーをください!","vocab":[{"t":"ごはん","r":"gohan","en":"rice / meal","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ぎゅうにゅう","r":"gyuunyu","en":"milk","pos":"noun"},{"t":"チーズ","r":"chiizu","en":"cheese","pos":"noun"},{"t":"にく","r":"niku","en":"meat","pos":"noun"},{"t":"さかな","r":"sakana","en":"fish","pos":"noun"},{"t":"りんご","r":"ringo","en":"apple","pos":"noun"},{"t":"おちゃ","r":"ocha","en":"tea","pos":"noun"},{"t":"コーヒー","r":"koohii","en":"coffee","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"がすきです / がほしいです","explain":"さかながすきです (I like fish), おちゃがほしいです (I want tea). すき = liked-thing + です. Negative: すきじゃありません. だいすき = big-like = love!","pattern":"X が + すきです/ほしいです","examples":[{"t":"さかながすきです。","r":"sakana-ga suki desu.","en":"I like fish."},{"t":"おちゃがほしいです。","r":"ocha-ga hoshii desu.","en":"I want tea."},{"t":"すしがだいすきです!","r":"sushi-ga daisuki desu!","en":"I love sushi!"}],"mistakes":["Saying さかなをすきです — likes need が, not を!","Saying ほしいます — ほしい is an adjective + です!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ゆき","t":"なにがすきですか?","r":"nani-ga suki desu ka?","en":"What do you like?"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"さかながすきです!","r":"sakana-ga suki desu!","en":"I like fish!"},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"わたしはおちゃがほしいです!","r":"watashi-wa ocha-ga hoshii desu!","en":"I want tea!"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"わたしもコーヒーがほしいです!","r":"watashi-mo koohii-ga hoshii desu!","en":"I want coffee too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I like fish","answer":"さかながすきです"},{"type":"fill","q":"おちゃが___です。 (want)","answer":"ほしい"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I love sushi!' is…","options":["すしをたべます","すしがだいすきです","すしがほしいです","すしをください"],"answer":"すしがだいすきです"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: すきです / さかなが","answer":"さかながすきです"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: さかながすきです。","answer":"さかながすきです。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"さかながすきです uses が because…","options":["object","liked-thing marker","place","time"],"answer":1,"why":"すき takes が!"},{"q":"ほしいです means…","options":["I like","I want","I eat","I drink"],"answer":1,"why":"ほしい = want (adj)."},{"q":"チーズ means…","options":["milk","cheese","meat","fish"],"answer":1,"why":"チーズ = cheese."},{"q":"だいすき means…","options":["like","love","want","need"],"answer":1,"why":"だいすき = big-like!"},{"q":"も means…","options":["too / also","not","please","very"],"answer":0,"why":"わたしも = me too."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Likes worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["fish","tea","apple"],"key":["さかな","おちゃ","りんご"]},{"instruction":"Like and want.","items":["I like fish","I want tea","I love sushi"],"key":["さかながすきです","おちゃがほしいです","すしがだいすきです"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["What do you like?","Me too!"],"key":["なにがすきですか","わたしも"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U3-L2","title":"Shopping: いくらですか","learn":"Shop in Japanese! いくらですか? (How much?), たかい (expensive), やすい (cheap). Money: えん (yen). これをください = I'll take this! Say いらっしゃいませ back? No — STAFF say it (welcome)!","vocab":[{"t":"ねだん","r":"nedan","en":"price","pos":"noun"},{"t":"おかね","r":"okane","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"えん","r":"en","en":"yen","pos":"noun"},{"t":"レシート","r":"reshiito","en":"receipt","pos":"noun"},{"t":"わりびき","r":"waribiki","en":"discount","pos":"noun"},{"t":"たかい","r":"takai","en":"expensive / high","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"やすい","r":"yasui","en":"cheap","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"ただ","r":"tada","en":"free","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"いくらですか? + をください","explain":"これはいくらですか? (How much is this?), ひゃくえんです (100 yen). これをください = this, please! たかい! = Expensive!","pattern":"いくらですか? · X をください","examples":[{"t":"これはいくらですか?","r":"kore-wa ikura desu ka?","en":"How much is this?"},{"t":"ひゃくえんです。","r":"hyaku-en desu.","en":"It's 100 yen."},{"t":"これをください!","r":"kore-o kudasai!","en":"This, please!"}],"mistakes":["Saying いくらか — shopping-how-much is いくらですか!","Saying これがください — take-this needs を!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ゆき","t":"これはいくらですか?","r":"kore-wa ikura desu ka?","en":"How much is this?"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"ひゃくえんです。","r":"hyaku-en desu.","en":"It's 100 yen."},{"sp":"ゆき","t":"たかい! チーズはいくらですか?","r":"takai! chiizu-wa ikura desu ka?","en":"Expensive! How much is the cheese?"},{"sp":"たろう","t":"やすいです! これをください!","r":"yasui desu! kore-o kudasai!","en":"It's cheap! I'll take this!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How much is this?","answer":"これはいくらですか"},{"type":"fill","q":"ひゃく___です。 (yen)","answer":"えん"},{"type":"choose","q":"'This, please!' is…","options":["これがください","これをください","これをほしい","これがいくら"],"answer":"これをください"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: いくらですか / これは","answer":"これはいくらですか"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: これはいくらですか?","answer":"これはいくらですか?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"いくらですか? means…","options":["How many?","How much?","Where is?","What is?"],"answer":1,"why":"いくら = how much."},{"q":"たかい means…","options":["cheap","expensive","free","new"],"answer":1,"why":"たかい = expensive/high."},{"q":"やすい means…","options":["cheap","expensive","tasty","big"],"answer":0,"why":"やすい = cheap."},{"q":"わりびき means…","options":["receipt","discount","price","shop"],"answer":1,"why":"わりびき = discount."},{"q":"これをください means…","options":["I see this","This, please","How much","I want go"],"answer":1,"why":"をください = please give."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Shopping worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Japanese.","items":["price","discount","cheap"],"key":["ねだん","わりびき","やすい"]},{"instruction":"Shop talk.","items":["How much is this?","It's 100 yen","This, please!"],"key":["これはいくらですか","ひゃくえんです","これをください"]},{"instruction":"React.","items":["Expensive!","Cheap!"],"key":["たかい","やすい"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"A2 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Yesterday I read a book","answer":"きのう、ほんをよみました"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Please look!","answer":"みてください"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I go to school'","options":["がっこうでいきます","がっこうへいきます","がっこうをいきます","がっこうにべんきょうします"],"answer":"がっこうへいきます"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"さかながすきです。","answer":"I like fish."},{"type":"fill","q":"がくせい___。 (was)","answer":"でした"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I am reading a book'","options":["ほんをよみます","ほんをよんでいます","ほんをよんでください","ほんをよみました"],"answer":"ほんをよんでいます"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: いきます / ろくじに","answer":"ろくじにいきます"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: さかながすきです。","answer":"さかながすきです。"},{"type":"fill","q":"これは___ですか? (how much)","answer":"いくら"},{"type":"choose","q":"いってきます!","options":["Welcome home","I'm off (and back)","Goodbye forever","Good night"],"answer":"I'm off (and back)"}]}}}